 "notes": [
  {
   "book": 5,
   "row": 51,
   "sec": 10,
   "append": true,
   "md": "- **RDX chemistry:** RDX is chemically **cyclotrimethylenetrinitramine**, written **(O₂NNCH₂)₃** (C₃H₆N₆O₆); picric acid (TNP) is **(O₂N)₃C₆H₂OH**."
  },
  {
   "book": 5,
   "row": 52,
   "sec": 2,
   "append": true,
   "md": "- **VIMARSH 2026:** DRDO–industry synergy meet (New Delhi, 15 Sep 2026); its new measures (funding, incubation, DRDO test facilities, source-code sharing) are aimed at **MSMEs and start-ups**."
  },
  {
   "book": 5,
   "row": 53,
   "sec": 1,
   "append": true,
   "md": "- **Scenarios Towards Viksit Bharat and Net Zero (NITI Aayog, 2026):** renewables are projected to give about **80% of power generation by 2070**, while coal's share falls sharply."
  },
  {
   "book": 5,
   "row": 53,
   "sec": 5,
   "append": true,
   "md": "- **First NDC (2015):** cut emission intensity of GDP by **33–35% by 2030** versus 2005, with about **40% non-fossil** power capacity."
  },
  {
   "book": 5,
   "row": 53,
   "sec": 4,
   "append": true,
   "md": "- **Regional imbalances:** poor **storage** and slow **transmission** can strand renewable power in some regions; heatwaves add stress on grids."
  },
  {
   "book": 5,
   "row": 54,
   "sec": 5,
   "append": true,
   "md": "- **Phase I when full:** 5.33 MMT would give about **9.5 days** of India's crude oil needs."
  },
  {
   "book": 5,
   "row": 54,
   "sec": 6,
   "append": true,
   "md": "- **OALP:** **Open Acreage Licensing Policy** under HELP; companies choose and bid for blocks for upstream exploration and production."
  },
  {
   "book": 5,
   "row": 54,
   "sec": 7,
   "append": true,
   "md": "- **Methanol Economy:** the programme is driven by **NITI Aayog**."
  }
 ],
